          "label": "C",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>0,0012</mn><mo>·</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mn>2,5</mn></math>"
        }
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "answer": {
        "correct": "C",
        "solution_html": null,
        "model": {
          "answer": "B",
          "by": "sonnet",
          "agrees": false,
          "solution_html": "<p>A: −1200/1000 = −1,2. D: (−3+2 13/25)·2,5 = (−0,48)·2,5 = −1,2. C: −0,0012·10³ = −1,2 (standard/exponential form). B: −√[(6³·2²)/(20²:2³)] = −√(864/50) = −√17,28 ≈ −4,157 ≠ −1,2.</p><p>Answer: B.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
